{'symbol': 'CAH', 'date': '2022-12-19 06:55:00', 'title': 'CARDINAL HEALTH NAMES AARON ALT CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER', 'text': "DUBLIN, OHIO , DEC. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CARDINAL HEALTH (NYSE: CAH) AND ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT AARON ALT WILL BECOME THE COMPANY'S NEW CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER (CFO). ALT WILL SUCCEED INTERIM CFO, TRISH ENGLISH AND WILL REPORT TO CEO, JASON HOLLAR, AS A MEMBER OF THE COMPANY'S EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE EFFECTIVE FEB. 10."}